The Violet Hour color palette is original work. No color values are taken
or adapted from any other theme.

This repository does redistribute one third-party file:

  scripts/baseline-keys.json

It is a verbatim copy of ThemeConverterTests/TestFiles/Complete_Dark.json
from Microsoft's theme-converter-for-vs:

  https://github.com/microsoft/theme-converter-for-vs

It is used as the authoritative list of Visual Studio Code workbench color
keys that ThemeConverter requires a theme to define. Only the key names are
used; every color value in the shipped theme is generated from
theme/palette.json.

